<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="33919468">&lt;p&gt;
    As the implementation tasks get completed, the program/project team should seek to gather information from the parts of
    the organization that are most impacted by the change as they start to adopt new ways of working. The process by which
    this is done may vary depending on the size and scale of the program/project and may include:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Focus groups
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        User surveys
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Informal contact with change network
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Reviews with Finance and other key departments
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;</attribute>
